"setup.recording.title.granted" = "Screen Recording";
"setup.recording.body" = "Live wallpapers such as Sequoia, Macintosh and the aerials have no picture file, so Sheer has to read the wallpaper from the screen. It only looks at the wallpaper, and nothing is saved or sent anywhere. Until it's allowed, Sheer shows the normal menu bar with these wallpapers. macOS may ask to quit and reopen Sheer afterwards.";
"setup.recording.button" = "Open Screen Recording Settings";

